<title>USA: The Macerich Co completes stock offer.</title>
<headline>The Macerich Co completes stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Macerich Co said on Friday it has completed an offer of 5.0 million common shares via underwriter Lehman Brothers, raising slightly over $106 million for the company.</p>
<p>Underwriters hold a 30-day option to acquire 750,000 more shares to cover over allotments, the company said.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay a $60 million mortgage recently placed on Valley View Shopping Center in Dallas, Texas acquired on October 22, and to repay Macerich's's line of credit. The remainder will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
